# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
#
# Every page has a Markdown copy at index.md for AI agents (docs/agents.md). It
# says the same thing as the page, so keep it out of search results, where it
# would compete with the HTML. Name the charset so the degree signs and dashes
# survive in clients that would otherwise guess.
/*.md
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/llms.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
